+supremeai-core CI triage, Render dashboard build logs). Submitted by the autonomous
+contributor agent (cron job 478318, cycle 51). Probe plane: MCP Control Tower
+zero-credential read tools (`system_health`, `github.workflow_runs`). Atomic claim
+held on #2225 at 2026-10-29T23:14:58Z (GRANT_RENEW) purely to serialize this
+addendum; release follows submission.
